@nsobid-AEE8F150DDA1B5A838806E1A5EA6827AD9F3C51E

@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Native mouse look. The camera controller's angle setter 0x99437c0 (yaw at +0x360, the pitch arc position t as a
// double at +0x700) first takes the mouse words that the runtime adds at guest 0x9943980 (a float of yaw in radians,
// then a float of the arc), adds them to the angle and to t (limited to 0 and 1), and clears the words. The code
// is in the words that the setter's mode 1 path frees: its end was a copy of the end of the mode 0 path, so it
// jumps there now (0x9943930 to 0x9943990).
@enabled
